```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant PR as Pull Request
    participant Agent as AI Agent (Copilot)
    participant Config as wow/config.yaml
    participant Files as WoW Files
    participant Parent as Parent Level

    PR->>Agent: PR opened / updated
    Agent->>Config: Read config.yaml
    Config-->>Agent: File manifest + inherits_from

    Agent->>Agent: Filter files by applies_to: [pr]
    Agent->>Files: Load matching files (3-5 files)
    Files-->>Agent: Frontmatter + rule content

    alt Has inherits_from
        Agent->>Parent: Resolve parent config.yaml
        Parent-->>Agent: Parent manifest + files
        Agent->>Agent: Merge (field-level, hard rules locked)
    end

    Agent->>Agent: Evaluate PR against resolved rules

    alt Hard rule violated
        Agent->>PR: ❌ Blocking comment (enforcement: hard)
    else Soft rule not met
        Agent->>PR: 💡 Suggestion (enforcement: soft)
    else All rules pass
        Agent->>PR: ✅ WoW compliance check passed
    end
```
